            "review_title": "Review at Taj Mahal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "2persians\nCaerphilly County, United Kingdom149 contributions\n0\nA little gem!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nA great restaurant down an alley. Looks basic but the food more than makes up for it. Very friendly service. Always full of Indian/Pakistani customers which is always a good sign. We have been here several times and the never disappoints. The vegetable samosas are to die for, we even had for takeaway snacks some days. We have spent a lot of time in India and the food here compares very well with food we have had there. It is a family run restaurant with food cooked by Indian/Pakistani chef. If you love Indian food do not miss out on this place, little gem. Prices are very reasonable. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 13, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
