            "review_title": "Review at Taj Mahal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Pat\nUbud, Indonesia96 contributions\n0\nNot the best paneer butter masala\nMar 2023\nWent at this table for dinner. Restaurant is little and quite hidden in a small alley but I prefer that then other touristic streets whiteout any locals. So it thought I've found a good place! The establishment is clean, confortable and inviting. \n\nI ordered a paneer butter masala with a butter naan bread. It cost me 110000 dongs, witch is reasonable. The dish was a bit small with not that much of sauce. I asked it spicy so there were pieces of hot green peppers in it. It's a way to dressed a dish but personally, the noble one consist to mixed the good seasoning. I hardly found any taste of cinnamon, honey nor garam masala in the sauce. Was a bit disappointed. The butter naan bread didn't have any if not so little, but it was huge and quite well cooked. \n\nMaybe the other meals on the menu taste better?\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 12, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
