            "review_title": "Review at Taj Mahal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Bartlett R\n2 contributions\n0\nLong Time Favourite\nDec 2022 • Solo\nI first had dinner at Taj Mahal in July 2001 and was a regular til 2005, dropping by thenafter through the years. Once right after the Ambassador from Pakistani had lunch. I got his dessert platter! Good with tea. <fast forward> Last night was pleased to find Zaman has reopened after a C0vid hiatus. I had Chicken tikka masala and pulao. Very good. The pulao wasnt to my taste, could use some peas, but still good. I will defintely go back on my next trip to Saigon for other dishes like Palak Paneer and Chicken Korma, and naan bread.\nRead more\nWritten December 9, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
