            "review_text": "Fastjet58\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam38 contributions\n0\nAs good as everyone says\nNov 2020 • Solo\nAll my friends that love Indian food in Saigon have always raved about how good the Taj Mahal is \nFrankly speaking I have never been a fan of Indian food as it never met my expectations of tastes after it smells so good ..\nBut I had to give Taj a try so went and ordered the butter chicken and garlic cheese nan .\nBoy I am glad I did as it has made me a new fan of Indian food .\nThe butter chicken is boneless and of good quality the sauce was just the rite amounted spice and was thick and even a little bit sweet .\nNan was really good and overall the amount of food was more than enough for one person two could probably share if they ordered another nan and some samosas \nThe service was some of the most professional I have had in Vietnam and the restaurant was spotless clean \nFor sure will be making this my go to restaurant in Ho Chi Minh city\nRead more\nWritten November 2, 2020",
