            "review_title": "Review at Taj Mahal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Roy f\nNewark-on-Trent, United Kingdom200 contributions\n1\nTasty Indian Food\nJan 2020 • Couples\nWe visited this Indian restaurant which is in a small lane that runs between two major roads which means it is relatively quiet away from the madding throng. It seems popular it is small and all the tables were occupied beware if you're a single traveller you are likely to be moved to make way for others. The food was tasty good value for money but they do not sale alcohol and the meat halal so I guess they are of muslim persuasion. There is little ambience it's more a cafe than restaurant but if you're looking for tasty Indian food it's worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten January 24, 2020",
